---
// Three microbenchmark distortions verified on Go 1.27.1 (Apple M2):
// 1. Setup inside the b.N timer vs b.ResetTimer() / b.Loop()
// 2. Dead-code elimination in for i < b.N vs for b.Loop() runtime.KeepAlive
// 3. Observer effect: reused warm cache vs fresh matrix allocation
const W = 900;
const H = 430;
---
<figure class="gp17c">
  <div class="gp17c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three Go 1.27 microbenchmark traps contrasted with their fixes: setup inside the timer inflates Lookup to 25,382 ns/op vs 12 ns/op with ResetTimer; ignored return values let SSA delete popcnt down to 0.34 ns/op vs 2.42 ns/op inside b.Loop; reusing one matrix warms CPU caches down to 4.5 µs vs 9.2 µs for fresh matrices.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Three microbenchmark traps vs fixes (measured on Go 1.27.1, Apple M2)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ba bẫy microbenchmark và cách sửa (đo thật trên Go 1.27.1, Apple M2)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Column headers */}
    <text x="20" y="54" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Trap</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cái bẫy</tspan></text>
    <text x="210" y="54" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>Broken benchmark</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Viết sai (số ảo)</tspan></text>
    <text x="560" y="54" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Fixed benchmark</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Viết đúng (số thật)</tspan></text>
    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="64" y2="64" class="rule" />

    {/* Row 1: Setup timer */}
    <text x="20" y="102" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>1. Setup in timer</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Setup trong timer</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="124" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>100k map fixture</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tạo map 100k mục</tspan></text>

    <rect x="210" y="78" width="310" height="82" rx="8" class="hot" />
    <text x="224" y="100" class="r">timer on during buildTodoIndex</text>
    <text x="224" y="122" class="m num">Run 1 · 25,382 ns/op · 6,736 B/op</text>
    <text x="224" y="142" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Setup leaks into B/op &amp; b.N estimate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Setup lọt vào B/op và lần ước lượng b.N</tspan></text>

    <line x1="522" x2="548" y1="119" y2="119" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="556,119 547,114 547,124" class="ah" />

    <rect x="560" y="78" width="320" height="82" rx="8" class="goldbox" />
    <text x="574" y="100" class="b">b.ResetTimer() / for b.Loop()</text>
    <text x="574" y="122" class="b num">10.4 – 14.7 ns/op · 0 B/op</text>
    <text x="574" y="142" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>b.Loop() resets timer on first iteration</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>b.Loop() tự reset timer trước vòng 0</tspan></text>

    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="184" y2="184" class="rule" />

    {/* Row 2: Dead-code elimination */}
    <text x="20" y="222" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>2. Dead-code pass</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Xóa code chết</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="244" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Unused return value</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bỏ quên giá trị trả về</tspan></text>

    <rect x="210" y="198" width="310" height="82" rx="8" class="hot" />
    <text x="224" y="220" class="r">{'for i < b.N { popcnt(uint64(i)) }'}</text>
    <text x="224" y="242" class="m num">0.34 ns/op · empty ADD+CMP loop</text>
    <text x="224" y="262" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>SSA deletes pure call completely</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SSA cắt sạch thân hàm thuần túy</tspan></text>

    <line x1="522" x2="548" y1="239" y2="239" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="556,239 547,234 547,244" class="ah" />

    <rect x="560" y="198" width="320" height="82" rx="8" class="goldbox" />
    <text x="574" y="220" class="b">{'for b.Loop() { popcnt(x); x++ }'}</text>
    <text x="574" y="242" class="b num">2.42 – 2.55 ns/op · LSR/AND/MUL kept</text>
    <text x="574" y="262" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Compiler wraps args/results in KeepAlive</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Compiler bọc KeepAlive giữ code chạy thật</tspan></text>

    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="304" y2="304" class="rule" />

    {/* Row 3: Observer effect */}
    <text x="20" y="342" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>3. Cache warming</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. Cache ấm ảo</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="364" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Reused input slice</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng lại 1 ma trận</tspan></text>

    <rect x="210" y="318" width="310" height="82" rx="8" class="hot" />
    <text x="224" y="340" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>Same matrix reused across all calls</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lặp nghìn lần trên cùng một vùng RAM</tspan></text>
    <text x="224" y="362" class="m num">BenchmarkSum512Reuse · 4.1 – 7.4 µs/op</text>
    <text x="224" y="382" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>First 8 columns stay hot in CPU L1/L2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>8 cột đầu nằm sẵn trong L1/L2 cache</tspan></text>

    <line x1="522" x2="548" y1="359" y2="359" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="556,359 547,354 547,364" class="ah" />

    <rect x="560" y="318" width="320" height="82" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="574" y="340" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Fresh cold input (or realistic stream)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cấp dữ liệu mới mỗi lượt (hoặc stream)</tspan></text>
    <text x="574" y="362" class="b num">BenchmarkSum512Fresh · 8.1 – 12.8 µs/op</text>
    <text x="574" y="382" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Shows real DRAM fetch cost (~2x slower)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hiện rõ chi phí nạp từ RAM (~chậm gấp đôi)</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>All six numbers come from Go 1.27.1 runs on Apple M2. Each trap shrinks or bloats ns/op by 2x–2,000x without changing the production code under test.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cả sáu số liệu đều đo trực tiếp trên Go 1.27.1 (Apple M2). Mỗi cái bẫy làm lệch ns/op từ 2 lần đến 2.000 lần mà code production chẳng hề thay đổi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp17c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp17c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp17c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp17c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp17c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17c .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17c .m { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17c .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17c .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gp17c .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp17c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17c .goldbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17c .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp17c .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp17c .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17c .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp17c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
